        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Blue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: REST /api/v1 (frontend → service)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Purple&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: GraphQL /api/graphql&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Red dashed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: RabbitMQ events (service ↔ service)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Grey dashed&lt;/b&gt;: OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect&lt;br&gt;Green: microservices (7) · Orange: event-driven support services&lt;br&gt;Purple cylinders: data owned by one service&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Patterns&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Database per service, no sync service-to-service calls&lt;br&gt;• CQRS: Scheduling (GraphQL read side), Leave&lt;br&gt;• Saga with compensation: leave approval&lt;br&gt;• Snapshot events + balance snapshots&lt;br&gt;• Tombstones on delete · immutable leave ledger&lt;br&gt;• Idempotency-Key on POST, eventId dedupe&lt;br&gt;• Commutative handlers (highest aggregateVersion wins)&lt;br&gt;• Transactional outbox · serverless function&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Contracts: /contracts (OpenAPI · GraphQL · AsyncAPI)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="330" x="1390" y="-40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="saga-note" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;Leave-approval saga&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Leave: APPROVAL_PENDING + ledger RESERVATION → &lt;i&gt;approval-started&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Scheduling releases overlapping assignments → &lt;i&gt;leave-release.completed&lt;/i&gt; | &lt;i&gt;rejected&lt;/i&gt; (locked shift)&lt;br&gt;3a. completed → APPROVED&lt;br&gt;3b. rejected / timeout → compensate: ledger REVERSAL + REJECTED" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="330" x="1390" y="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ai-note" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;AI workflow&lt;/b&gt;: shift becomes understaffed → &lt;i&gt;shift.understaffed&lt;/i&gt; (with candidates) → AI Service asks the LLM to rank them → &lt;i&gt;ai.replacement.suggested&lt;/i&gt; → shown in GraphQL + notification. Advisory only; rule-based fallback if the LLM is down." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="330" x="1390" y="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
